{"id":702,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Since Dedenne can’t generate much electricity on its own, it steals electricity from outlets or other electric Pokémon."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"A Dedenne’s whiskers pick up electrical waves other Dedenne send out. These Pokémon share locations of food or electricity with one another."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Its upper whiskers are sensors that survey its surroundings. Its lower whiskers are organs that shoot electricity."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It sneaks into people’s homes and steals electricity from their outlets. When your electric bill seems off, it’s the handiwork of this rascal."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y"],"text":"It uses its tail to absorb electricity from power plants or from outlets in houses, and then it fires the electricity from its whiskers."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X"],"text":"Its whiskers serve as antennas. By sending and receiving electrical waves, it can communicate with others over vast distances."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Cheek Pouch","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's HP is restored when it eats any Berry, in addition to the Berry's usual effect."},{"name":"Pickup","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may pick up an item another Pokémon used during a battle. It may pick up items outside of battle, too."},{"name":"Plus","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Sp. Atk stat of the Pokémon if an ally with the Plus or Minus Ability is also in battle."}],"eggGroups":["Field","Fairy"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Yellow","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":702,"name":"Dedenne","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,39],[1,609],[5,33],[10,268],[15,84],[20,204],[25,570],[30,521],[35,156],[35,173],[40,435],[45,583],[50,162],[55,494],[60,87]],"machine":[97,268,451,204,605,91,577,598,604,486,527,283,203,263,374,416,447,270,63,113,581,583,182,240,156,402,214,164,